{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/pulls/65483","id":3307617718,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAQzde87FJj22","html_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/65483","diff_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/65483.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/65483.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/65483","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/pulls/65483/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/pulls/65483/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/65483/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/statuses/2d8e25d03f7f52150c712a7a855ebf84c408b103","number":65483,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Simplify and unify TempData and SupplyParameterFromSession serialization","user":{"login":"dariatiurina","id":110841893,"node_id":"U_kgDOBptQJQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/110841893?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dariatiurina","html_url":"https://github.com/dariatiurina","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dariatiurina/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dariatiurina/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dariatiurina/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dariatiurina/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dariatiurina/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dariatiurina/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dariatiurina/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dariatiurina/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dariatiurina/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"# Simplify and unify TempData and SupplyParameterFromSession serialization\r\n\r\n## Summary\r\n\r\nReworks how Blazor endpoints serialize stored values so TempData and `[SupplyParameterFromSession]` share a single serializer. Stored values include a constrained type token, replacing the heuristic type inference previously used by TempData and enabling session-backed parameters to restore supported enums and collection types using their declared property type.\r\n\r\n## Changes\r\n\r\n- Introduces `IStoredDataSerializer` and `JsonStoredDataSerializer`, replacing the TempData-specific `ITempDataSerializer` and `JsonTempDataSerializer`.\r\n- Uses the shared serializer for cookie-backed TempData, session-backed TempData, and `[SupplyParameterFromSession]`.\r\n- Stores each non-null value as `{ \"type\": \"<token>\", \"value\": <json> }`. Type tokens omit assembly metadata, and `object[]` values are handled recursively so each element retains its own token.\r\n- Restricts serialization to `int`, `bool`, `string`, `Guid`, `DateTime`, `int`-backed enums, and nullable forms of those types. Supported containers are single-dimensional arrays, `List<T>`, `HashSet<T>`, `Collection<T>`, `Dictionary<string, T>`, and recursively stored `object[]`.\r\n- Normalizes enum tokens to `System.Int32` for TempData payload compatibility across enum types. When `[SupplyParameterFromSession]` supplies a declared target type, values are deserialized directly to that type so enums and supported collections retain the component property type.\r\n- Validates concrete `[SupplyParameterFromSession]` property types when subscriptions are created. Unsupported types fail with a clear `InvalidOperationException`; `object` and abstract property types remain deferred to runtime serialization.\r\n- Uses byte-based `ISession.Set` and `TryGetValue` instead of the previous string-based JSON path. Session keys are normalized to lowercase, `null` values remove the corresponding entry, and getter failures are logged without preventing other values from being persisted.\r\n- Moves unsupported-type enforcement into the serializer instead of duplicating validation in each TempData provider.\r\n- Updates the non-generic TempData enumerator path to use the same `Current` implementation as generic enumeration, ensuring enumerated entries are marked as consumed consistently.\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\n\r\n- Replaces `JsonTempDataSerializerTest` with `JsonStoredDataSerializerTest`, covering supported and unsupported types, clean type tokens, scalar and collection round trips, nullable values, `int`-backed enums, recursive `object[]` values, typed session-value serialization, and byte-identical TempData reserialization.\r\n- Updates session supplier and subscription tests to use typed byte payloads and adds coverage for unsupported property validation, lowercase keys, enum and collection restoration, missing session contexts, and persistence behavior.\r\n- Updates cookie and session TempData provider tests and dependency-injection tests to use the shared serializer.\r\n- Removes the complex custom-type `[SupplyParameterFromSession]` E2E scenario because arbitrary complex types are no longer supported. Existing E2E coverage continues to verify scalar values, missing values, redirects, and navigation persistence.\r\n\r\n## Breaking Changes\r\n\r\n- **Supported-type restriction:** `[SupplyParameterFromSession]` no longer persists arbitrary complex/custom types. Unsupported concrete property types now fail when the subscription is created, and unsupported runtime values fail during serialization.\r\n\r\nFixes #65231\r\n","labels":[{"id":1164776385,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTY0Nzc2Mzg1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/labels/area-blazor","name":"area-blazor","description":"Includes: Blazor, Razor Components","color":"5319e7","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14553412,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAQzde84A3hFE","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/mile